1
00:00:03,187 --> 00:00:06,276
Check the page for that task in the manual:

2
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:10,814
a table at the top names the menu, the permission and the feature.

3
00:00:10,814 --> 00:00:15,478
Without the permission, or with the feature off, the menu is hidden.

4
00:00:15,478 --> 00:00:19,197
A role's permissions are under Access Control, Roles.

5
00:00:19,652 --> 00:00:22,069
Some buttons need a site setting.

6
00:00:22,069 --> 00:00:27,089
Pause recording appears only when Allow agents to pause recording is on, in

7
00:00:27,089 --> 00:00:29,258
the Recording governance tab.

8
00:00:29,258 --> 00:00:35,952
Collect data securely needs Enable agent-assisted secure data capture, in the Secure Data Capture tab.

9
00:00:36,404 --> 00:00:41,409
The Diagnostics tab of the soft phone appears only when the administrator enables

10
00:00:41,409 --> 00:00:44,804
it, in the soft phone settings of Telephony settings.

11
00:00:46,404 --> 00:00:49,557
Some buttons appear only at the right moment.

12
00:00:49,557 --> 00:00:54,255
Listen, Whisper and Barge show on an agent's card only while the agent

13
00:00:54,255 --> 00:00:55,429
is on a call.

14
00:00:55,429 --> 00:00:59,633
Complete activity shows once there is an activity to complete.

15
00:00:59,633 --> 00:01:04,764
And the Agent role does not include the soft phone permission, so ask for it.

